              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Everything uses ease-out-expo cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1). With prefers-reduced-motion the sheet appears in place and the code renders complete — no reveal, no sweep.",
