                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "The mark pops in first (scale 0.4 → 1 with a slight overshoot). Modules follow in radial rings around it — each ring scales 0.6 → 1 and fades in over 380 ms, 40 ms after the one inside it — so the code appears to radiate out of the mark. The eyes arrive with the outermost ring. Total ≈ 560 ms.",
